---
source: tests/cli/help_snapshots_test.rs
expression: "help_output(&[\"--help\"])"
---
Inspect and edit XMind workbooks through an agent-native CLI

Usage: xmind [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  inspect     
  sheets      
  tree        
  find        
  get         
  add         
  add-tree    
  set         
  delete      
  move        
  copy        
  patch       
  diff        
  validate    
  export      
  import      
  backup      
  restore     
  completion  
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json                       
      --format <FORMAT>            [default: text] [possible values: text, json, compact-json, markdown, outline, assets]
      --fields <FIELDS>            
      --quiet                      
      --no-color                   
      --sheet <SHEET>              
      --sheet-id <SHEET_ID>        
      --sheet-index <SHEET_INDEX>  
  -h, --help                       Print help
  -V, --version                    Print version
